references and measurement notes that record where each behaviour came from.
Per-file provenance is recorded in the ``provenance`` field of every
implementation spec (see ``src/ascend_attention/spec.py``) and in
``MIGRATION_LOG.md``.

Files migrated verbatim (only relative import paths changed) from TileInfer at
commit 339969a:

  src/ascend_attention/utils.py                        <- tileinfer/utils.py
  src/ascend_attention/metadata.py                     <- tileinfer/metadata.py
  src/ascend_attention/plan.py                         <- tileinfer/plan.py
  src/ascend_attention/api.py                          <- tileinfer/attention/api.py
  src/ascend_attention/backends/base.py                <- tileinfer/attention/backends/base.py
  src/ascend_attention/backends/reference.py           <- tileinfer/attention/backends/reference.py
  src/ascend_attention/testing/*.py                    <- tileinfer/testing/*.py
  src/ascend_attention/ops/gdn/gating.py               <- tileinfer/kernels/gdn/__init__.py
  tests/test_attention_api.py                          <- tests/test_attention_api.py
  tests/test_gdn_gating.py                             <- tests/test_gdn_gating.py

The ABI helpers in ``src/ascend_attention/abi.py`` are a consolidation of
``tileinfer/kernels/attention/paged_decode_ascend950.py`` (``padded_rows``,
``declared_pool_cap``, ``pool_view``) and ``tileinfer/serving/buckets.py``
(``capacity_view``).
